WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.620
What's up everybody!

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:02.340
We are Pongfinity

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.520
And today we are back at the streets of Helsinki

00:00:04.529 --> 00:00:06.479
This time we have 5 items

00:00:06.479 --> 00:00:09.050
And we will play 1 match with each.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.650
If our challengers manage to beat us

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.290
They will get 10 euros.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.290
The weather isn't that great

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:16.760
But let's hope that people are up for the
challenge!

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.600
Alright, today we have 5 items.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:30.980
This is the first match.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:32.320
You get to choose which item I will play with!

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:38.100
The lamp!

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:40.640
The lamp?

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:41.800
Yep.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.680
Who do you think will win this match?

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:45.300
I will!

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:46.080
You will?

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.420
It's good to be confident!

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:50.020
Let's start!

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:51.000
0-0!

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:00.740
So lucky for me.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:01.560
Sorry!

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:16.200
0-3

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:36.880
1-5

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:50.160
Nice shot!

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:14.960
No chance

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:18.800
9-3

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:33.280
I had to try!

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:43.080
Thank you!

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:46.820
The lamp was pretty good!

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:53.000
I'll choose the scissors!

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.320
Alright!

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:58.740
That was somewhat expected

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:00.040
Let's go with these scissors!

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:03.500
That's a good handicap

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:07.720
1-0

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:09.460
Not a good start for me

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:10.780
I have the wind on my side

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:11.400
True

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:20.720
My first point!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.860
5-4

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.380
It's a tight match!

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.400
6-6

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:14.440
It's getting a bit critical now

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:21.240
9-7

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:24.720
10-7

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:26.360
You have 3 match points

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:33.160
Good match!

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:37.000
You played well with the scissors!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:37.920
Here is the prize

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:39.160
Keep the 10 euros

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:44.000
This was a fun afternoon exercise!

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.040
Are you sure?

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.600
Yeah, it's fine!

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:48.720
Alright, thanks!

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:51.240
Was fun to play!

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:53.720
Wow, what a guy!

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:55.080
Such a nice guy!

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:57.920
It was so challenging to play with the scissors.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:58.960
It was the service

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:00.720
I couldn't somehow hit it

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:02.560
The wind was coming towards me

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:04.560
So it was very difficult to hit the ball...

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:06.720
Don't try to blame it on the wind!

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:09.200
You were just not very good.

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:10.640
Okay...

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:12.040
Maybe!

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:16.680
Okay

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:18.520
Which item shall I play with?

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.540
Pick the most difficult one!

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:23.720
Alright, let's go with the candle?

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:24.780
Yeah

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:27.600
Ok, let's see how it goes.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:28.520
0-0

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:54.240
1-3

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:16.380
Nice!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.520
4-3

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:32.640
This is fun!

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:04.480
Thank you!

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:05.660
Great!

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:07.240
You played well!

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:13.360
We have 2 items left

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:15.220
Which item do you want me to play with?

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:16.000
I'll choose this one

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.000
The iron

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:18.740
Great choice!

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:44.880
4-3

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.440
7-4

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:24.160
The wind made it short

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:31.040
Good try!

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:44.720
That was close!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.880
Match point!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.400
That was it

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:56.800
Thank you!

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.000
Nicely played

00:08:58.020 --> 00:08:58.900
You were not far from winning!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:10.800
Nope, didn't work

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:12.240
I had to try it

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:20.000
Miikka: Don't break my toaster!

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.240
Are you still using it?

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:23.520
I made my breakfast with it!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.880
Nice shot!

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:43.200
I almost dropped the toaster!

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:57.840
I should probably hold on the cable

00:09:58.460 --> 00:09:59.900
Yeah that was a good bluff

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:01.580
Let's take a new point

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:03.040
It's fine!

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:04.960
4-7

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:12.240
8-5.

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:13.200
My serve

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:28.640
Close!

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:29.920
10-6

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:33.460
The toaster seems to be good for this!

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:36.560
Alright, that was it!

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:38.240
Thank you!

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:38.900
It

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.300
was nice to play!

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:44.440
You were starting to get a good feeling for
the playing!

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:46.640
Alright, that's a wrap then for today

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:48.860
We had 5 items with us

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:51.300
We won 4 matches, lost 1

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:52.980
The only one that was causing some problems

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:53.980
Was the scissors

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:55.430
But, it's still pretty good

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:56.850
Hope you enjoyed this episode

00:10:56.850 --> 00:11:00.000
If you have ideas what items we should use
next time

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.000
Comment below

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:01.980
Until next time!

